The Go standard library (BSD-3-Clause, Copyright The Go Authors) only.

Interop test peers (interop/, not part of the module's packages)
------------------------------------------------------------------

The nested test-only module interop/ runs these in Docker containers
built on the tester's machine; none of their code or files is included
in this repository or linked into the module:

- knxd 0.14.54.1 (github.com/knxd/knxd, GPL-2.0, from Debian bookworm),
  as a KNXnet/IP tunnelling server.
- xknx 3.20.0 (MIT) and xknxproject 3.10.0 (GPL-2.0-only), from PyPI, to
  read ETS files and, with xknx, as the other KNX IP router;
  interop/xknx/peer.py and routing.py, which drive them, are ours
  (Apache-2.0).
- The sample keyrings of xknx's test suite and the sample projects of
  xknxproject's test suite (files written by ETS), fetched from their
  repositories at those tags when the image is built.

